  "debugger_limitation": "Connect reset peripheral registers while preserving older RAM; configuration diagnosis uses the explicit fresh stopped run, not the initial post-connect peripheral values",
  "cause": "Reading UCA1IV acknowledges TXIFG. When the queue becomes empty, TXIE is disabled; later enqueue only re-enabled TXIE and did not re-arm the now-cleared TXIFG, so no further TX interrupt occurred.",
  "fix": "Atomically enqueue and re-arm TXIFG before enabling an idle UART1 transmitter. Preserve nonblocking output, motion supervision and pump-disabled configuration.",
